      "content": "We can rephrase the representative example to maintain a professional tone while adhering to our brand standards. Here's a revised version:\n\n\"Regrettably, I've encountered issues with my recent order. I would appreciate it if you could expedite the resolution and provide me with the correct products. I expect a prompt and satisfactory outcome, as I have paid for the services rendered.\"\n\nRegarding risk mitigation, I recommend implementing a \"Linguistic Quality Filter\" to segregate transcripts with low-standard language from our premium training modules. This approach will help maintain our brand's professional image and prevent potential dilution of our corporate reputation. By separating these transcripts into a lower-priority archive, we can ensure that our high-tier training assets remain uncompromised by substandard language.",
      "source": "target",
